# Flask routes

- `app.py` must not import `requests` or call external APIs directly.
- Routes delegate to `fetcher.get_cached_weather()` and `fetcher.refresh_weather()` only.
- Return HTTP 503 when cache `status` is not `"ok"` and render `_error.html`.
- Scheduler setup belongs in `scheduler.init_scheduler()`, invoked from `create_app()` when enabled.
- Keep route handlers short; no cache file parsing in routes.
- JSON routes may use `jsonify`; still delegate to `fetcher` only.
